THOUGHT: Start by creating the `t10_debounce.js` file with the debounce function.
ACTION: write_file
PATH: t10_debounce.js
```javascript
module.exports = function debounce(fn, ms) {
  let timeout;
  return function(...args) {
    clearTimeout(timeout);
    timeout = setTimeout(() => fn.apply(this, args), ms);
  };
};
```

